{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/projects/checkerboard/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"id":"c3a800b6-1ba1-5712-ac6f-f46890f8fc4f","html":"<figure style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 51.25000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/8ac56/checkerboard2.webp 240w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/d3be9/checkerboard2.webp 480w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/e46b2/checkerboard2.webp 960w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/f992d/checkerboard2.webp 1440w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/882b9/checkerboard2.webp 1920w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/788d7/checkerboard2.webp 2998w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/8ff5a/checkerboard2.png 240w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/e85cb/checkerboard2.png 480w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/d9199/checkerboard2.png 960w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/07a9c/checkerboard2.png 1440w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/29114/checkerboard2.png 1920w,\n/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/f705e/checkerboard2.png 2998w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/c91186f5005c4c4f4b33b69f72de6fb1/d9199/checkerboard2.png\" alt=\"wip title page\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>HTML web app coupled with a Node server hosted on Vercel</figcaption><br>\n  <b><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem;\">\n    <a href=\"https://kayleecragg.github.io/tennis/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>\n  </div>\n  <b>\n</b></b></figure>\n<ul>\n<li>Developed a real-time tennis tournament checkerboard web application using <strong>HTML/CSS/JavaScript</strong> that aggregates live match data from a custom-made API (hosted on <strong>Vercel</strong>).</li>\n<li>Able to give notifications when a match changes court or players.</li>\n<li>Widely used by my company’s live operations team during large tennis tournaments to keep up to date on court and player changes, as well as to keep track of the matches on their assigned court.</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"making-a-project-while-on-shift\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#making-a-project-while-on-shift\" aria-label=\"making a project while on shift permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Making a project while on shift</h1>\n<h2 id=\"2025\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#2025\" aria-label=\"2025 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>2025</h2>\n<p><strong>Context:</strong> My company broadcasts tennis grand slams. To keep up to date with the latests scores, games and players on different courts, we used to utilise a checkerboard that the grand slam organisation would provide for all broadcasters to use.</p>\n<p><strong>Problem:</strong> <em>The Checkerboard is down!</em></p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 40px;\">\n  <figure style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">\n    <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 692px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 38.33333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/8ac56/normal_checkerboard.webp 240w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/d3be9/normal_checkerboard.webp 480w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/f686e/normal_checkerboard.webp 692w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 692px) 100vw, 692px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/8ff5a/normal_checkerboard.png 240w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/e85cb/normal_checkerboard.png 480w,\n/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/91e7e/normal_checkerboard.png 692w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 692px) 100vw, 692px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/73c6253a32d7ead475091e999a99cb82/91e7e/normal_checkerboard.png\" alt=\"normal checkerboard\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption>5 days before the tournament started, our normal checkerboard that we used for monitoring match updates was expected to work fine</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <figure style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">\n    <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 806px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 64.58333333333334%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/8ac56/checkerboard_down.webp 240w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/d3be9/checkerboard_down.webp 480w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/e94a4/checkerboard_down.webp 806w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 806px) 100vw, 806px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/8ff5a/checkerboard_down.png 240w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/e85cb/checkerboard_down.png 480w,\n/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/764be/checkerboard_down.png 806w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 806px) 100vw, 806px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/17b6603d661c26492b1b6e310589e000/764be/checkerboard_down.png\" alt=\"checkerboard down\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n    <figcaption>Come Day 1, it was broken.</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n<p>How did it break? So apparently the source for the original checkerboard (SMT) was changing their licensing, and so their checkerboard just didn’t work for the entirety of Roland Garros 2025..</p>\n<p>Anyways, this was inconvenient for my team, so I tried looking for alternatives.</p>\n<p>First I tried some random sports betting API coupled with another Roland Garros tennis court API. And it worked? But not very reliably? And it also didn’t give me very much useful information.\nLike barely anything at all.</p>\n<p>And then I tried to hastily slap it together with a really ugly UI.</p>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 47.08333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/8ac56/early.webp 240w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/d3be9/early.webp 480w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/e46b2/early.webp 960w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/f992d/early.webp 1440w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/882b9/early.webp 1920w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/8488f/early.webp 1956w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/8ff5a/early.png 240w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/e85cb/early.png 480w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/d9199/early.png 960w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/07a9c/early.png 1440w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/29114/early.png 1920w,\n/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/0faf1/early.png 1956w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/bd1a0b70eb6087c7244ec39af213f8ef/d9199/early.png\" alt=\"early\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>An early version of the makeshift checkerboard, ugly UI but better than nothing</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>I thought surely there was a better way to get this information (and for free? I had to do a free trial for those sports betting APIs access)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I went to Roland Garros’ order of play website and inspected the networks tab, found that it was calling this API: <a href=\"https://www.rolandgarros.com/api/en-us/polling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.rolandgarros.com/api/en-us/polling</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 63.74999999999999%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/8ac56/inspecting.webp 240w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/d3be9/inspecting.webp 480w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/e46b2/inspecting.webp 960w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/f992d/inspecting.webp 1440w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/991ad/inspecting.webp 1567w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/09b79/inspecting.jpg 240w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/7cc5e/inspecting.jpg 480w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/6a068/inspecting.jpg 960w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/644c5/inspecting.jpg 1440w,\n/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/68857/inspecting.jpg 1567w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/abc8287ac7a1f0ab34e3b0f9f06a7932/6a068/inspecting.jpg\" alt=\"inspecting\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>inspecting Roland Garros' order of play website</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>I thought maybe I could use it too, but that API had CORS protection?</li>\n<li>So I had to make my own server/API to call it to bypass CORs.</li>\n<li>tldr: roland garros has an api but webpage browser cannot access because of CORS</li>\n</ul>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 33.33333333333333%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/8ac56/checkerboard1.webp 240w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/d3be9/checkerboard1.webp 480w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/e46b2/checkerboard1.webp 960w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/af3f0/checkerboard1.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/09b79/checkerboard1.jpg 240w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/7cc5e/checkerboard1.jpg 480w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/6a068/checkerboard1.jpg 960w,\n/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/eea4a/checkerboard1.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/jpeg\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/c9b3fe1edcf2aa4363e636e69fc8593b/6a068/checkerboard1.jpg\" alt=\"checkerboard1\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>new features: notifications for court and player changes, and dark mode</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 910px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 58.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/8ac56/2025-shoutout.webp 240w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/d3be9/2025-shoutout.webp 480w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/92674/2025-shoutout.webp 910w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 910px) 100vw, 910px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/8ff5a/2025-shoutout.png 240w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/e85cb/2025-shoutout.png 480w,\n/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/c6bbc/2025-shoutout.png 910w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 910px) 100vw, 910px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/e0b1e2d2f65ca2a36c0e1d663f383b6f/c6bbc/2025-shoutout.png\" alt=\"2025 shoutout\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>my boss(es) were happy with my creation :)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 55.41666666666667%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/8ac56/checkerboard.webp 240w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/d3be9/checkerboard.webp 480w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/e46b2/checkerboard.webp 960w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/f992d/checkerboard.webp 1440w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/882b9/checkerboard.webp 1920w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/8c8e0/checkerboard.webp 2992w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/8ff5a/checkerboard.png 240w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/e85cb/checkerboard.png 480w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/d9199/checkerboard.png 960w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/07a9c/checkerboard.png 1440w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/29114/checkerboard.png 1920w,\n/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/c3611/checkerboard.png 2992w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/8dd380a7bd96042569684ddd06c1aaa6/d9199/checkerboard.png\" alt=\"checkerboard\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>refining the UI so that it was easier to read the scores at first glance, <br>added special tags for australian players (for our specific business usecase)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<!-- <figure>\n  <img src=\"/notif.png\" />\n  <figcaption>Preview of what it would actually look like in action, notification system</figcaption>\n</figure> -->\n<!-- \nSo after the first few days of me having this system up, my supervisor contacted the development team and asked if it was possible to put the site up on the wall monitors.\n\n\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"/important.png\" />\n  <figcaption>\"It is vital\" :)</figcaption>\n</figure> -->\n<ul>\n<li>uhh but i was hosting on my own machine using… nginx.. which brought uh multiple problems</li>\n<li>bad practice !!!! very very bad expose secrets</li>\n<li>so an engineer at work advised me to try hosting the server with vercel</li>\n<li>vercel server made so that bypass CORS</li>\n<li>vercel server queries <a href=\"https://www.rolandgarros.com/api/en-us/polling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.rolandgarros.com/api/en-us/polling</a> every time it is called by this web page (about every 1.5 seconds)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"2026\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#2026\" aria-label=\"2026 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>2026</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>anyways it got reused by my team the next year (2026) because the mis checkerboard still down since 2024..</li>\n</ul>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 115.83333333333334%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/8ac56/mis.webp 240w,\n/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/d3be9/mis.webp 480w,\n/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/e46b2/mis.webp 960w,\n/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/bb9fe/mis.webp 972w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/8ff5a/mis.png 240w,\n/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/e85cb/mis.png 480w,\n/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/d9199/mis.png 960w,\n/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/7ae9c/mis.png 972w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/6e63e04ef1bde4d398580a4a6f542d63/d9199/mis.png\" alt=\"mis\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n  <figcaption>down since 2024 :(</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 303px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 29.166666666666668%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/ff3ded4b7e63197b411b5e062480a2ad/8ac56/2026-shoutout.webp 240w,\n/static/ff3ded4b7e63197b411b5e062480a2ad/bac26/2026-shoutout.webp 303w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 303px) 100vw, 303px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/ff3ded4b7e63197b411b5e062480a2ad/8ff5a/2026-shoutout.png 240w,\n/static/ff3ded4b7e63197b411b5e062480a2ad/6728c/2026-shoutout.png 303w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 303px) 100vw, 303px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/ff3ded4b7e63197b411b5e062480a2ad/6728c/2026-shoutout.png\" alt=\"2026 shoutout\" title=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>improvements made recently to increase interval check from 20 seconds to 1.5 seconds (which resulted in updates to scores coming in faster 😎)</li>\n<li>this also allowed me to create a ad break notifier (since me company recently introduced ad breaks to customers)</li>\n<li>i built another website on top of the fast time event triggers to help notify people when during the match to take ad breaks (there are specific timings)</li>\n<li>can’t show this website for privacy purposes but!</li>\n<li>here is the audio cue for when to roll a break</li>\n</ul>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <figure>\n    <audio controls>\n      <source src=\"/24b52d601d82f686ab153b5013a7fac6/bell.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\n      Your browser does not support the audio element.\n    </audio>\n    <figcaption>actually an a5 music note (880hz) with a sine tone and fade in/out effect</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n</div>\n<p>anyways yeah good outcome :)</p>\n<figure>\n  <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 960px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 52.083333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/97b8b772e3c1dfe3f1912d20b174d0dc/8ac56/2026-april-award.webp 240w,\n/static/97b8b772e3c1dfe3f1912d20b174d0dc/d3be9/2026-april-award.webp 480w,\n/static/97b8b772e3c1dfe3f1912d20b174d0dc/e46b2/2026-april-award.webp 960w,\n/static/97b8b772e3c1dfe3f1912d20b174d0dc/f992d/2026-april-award.webp 1440w,\n/static/97b8b772e3c1dfe3f1912d20b174d0dc/882b9/2026-april-award.webp 1920w,\n/static/97b8b772e3c1dfe3f1912d20b174d0dc/f8990/2026-april-award.webp 2154w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/97b8b772e3c1dfe3f1912d20b174d0dc/8ff5a/2026-april-award.png 240w,